  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The Robertson Panel, a group of scientists the CIA brought together in 1953 to review UFO reports, is said to have advised that the government watch civilian UFO groups, and even get inside them. A former Air Force nuclear missile officer named Robert Salas says this comes from the panel's report, summing it up as \"let's keep an eye on UFO groups,\" which would mean the public's interest in UFOs was itself treated as something to monitor."
